{"4464810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Time‑Stealing Cat", "steam_appid": 4464810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4774710], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enemy Is the Hero.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Time-Stealing Cat</strong> is a top-down adventure RPG where you play as a cat serving the Demon King, sabotaging the heroes on their quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a typical RPG, the hero defeats the Demon King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in this game, you're on the Demon King's side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have only one mission:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delay the heroes for as long as possible before they reach the Demon King's Castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more time you buy, the stronger the Demon King becomes—and eventually, even the outcome of the final battle can change.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/72c78eac9984b03183166f55d00f8153.poster.avif?t=1785767957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/72c78eac9984b03183166f55d00f8153.webm?t=1785767957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/72c78eac9984b03183166f55d00f8153.mp4?t=1785767957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Throw the heroes' journey into chaos.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collapse bridges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block roads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy out valuable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/3603bb8ae8a2c7eef9bf87f582a21d4b.poster.avif?t=1785767957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/3603bb8ae8a2c7eef9bf87f582a21d4b.webm?t=1785767957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/3603bb8ae8a2c7eef9bf87f582a21d4b.mp4?t=1785767957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The heroes automatically travel across the world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a cat, you can stay one step ahead, using the world itself to interfere with their progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore towns, the Great Forest, the Goddess's Pond, Dragon Valley, and the Demon King's Castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is filled with unique locations and colorful inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore, you'll discover new items and events, unlocking even more ways to sabotage the heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/d748f4f1461422311b661dc9c13bd595.poster.avif?t=1785767957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/d748f4f1461422311b661dc9c13bd595.webm?t=1785767957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/d748f4f1461422311b661dc9c13bd595.mp4?t=1785767957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cat or Human?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In cat form, you're small, agile, and can slip into places others can't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In human form, you can talk with people, shop for items, and influence events directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between the two forms and outsmart the heroes at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroes are trying to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to stop them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey that normally lasts only ten minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But how much longer can you make it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That changes everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/157b3d7ca0c831fa58da581e39d5fd54.poster.avif?t=1785767957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/157b3d7ca0c831fa58da581e39d5fd54.webm?t=1785767957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/157b3d7ca0c831fa58da581e39d5fd54.mp4?t=1785767957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The enemy is the hero.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal time for the Demon King.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/6ca98c99ace9eca3039e207a1d1f9831.poster.avif?t=1785767957\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/6ca98c99ace9eca3039e207a1d1f9831.webm?t=1785767957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4464810/extras/6ca98c99ace9eca3039e207a1d1f9831.mp4?t=1785767957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enemy Is the Hero.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Time-Stealing Cat</strong> is a top-down adventure RPG where 